      "filename": "Beijing, Tiananmen Square, Great Hall of the People (6170353894).jpg",
      "title": "File:Beijing, Tiananmen Square, Great Hall of the People (6170353894).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Beijing%2C_Tiananmen_Square%2C_Great_Hall_of_the_People_%286170353894%29.jpg",
